1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,976
The Little Prince looked back one last time at his tiny planet.

2
00:00:04,926 --> 00:00:08,235
Then, he flew through the stars.

3
00:00:08,235 --> 00:00:12,470
First, he arrived at a planet full of houses.

4
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:16,955
A man sat on a tall chair, wearing a golden hat.

5
00:00:16,955 --> 00:00:19,014
I am the King!

6
00:00:19,014 --> 00:00:22,161
Everyone must obey my commands!

7
00:00:22,161 --> 00:00:26,897
The Little Prince asked, Then can you command the sun to set?

8
00:00:26,897 --> 00:00:29,588
The King thought for a moment...

9
00:00:29,588 --> 00:00:30,970
Hmm...

10
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:34,088
the sun doesn't listen very well.

11
00:00:34,088 --> 00:00:38,264
Then I command you... to ask me if you may set!

12
00:00:38,264 --> 00:00:41,999
The Little Prince thought this was very strange.

13
00:00:41,999 --> 00:00:45,249
Even a King can't make the sun obey.

14
00:00:45,249 --> 00:00:49,838
Qiqi whispered — Being a King must be so powerful!

15
00:00:49,838 --> 00:00:53,955
But with no friends to play with... wouldn't it be lonely?

16
00:00:53,955 --> 00:00:57,764
Next, he came to a very bright planet.

17
00:00:57,764 --> 00:01:02,264
A man wore shiny clothes and kept looking in the mirror.

18
00:01:02,264 --> 00:01:04,235
Am I handsome?

19
00:01:04,235 --> 00:01:06,205
Am I handsome?

20
00:01:06,205 --> 00:01:09,970
The Little Prince said, Yes, you are.

21
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:16,485
The man was happy for one second, then asked — Then tell me, am I the most handsome?

22
00:01:16,485 --> 00:01:21,852
The Little Prince walked away, and the man chased after him — Wait!

23
00:01:21,852 --> 00:01:24,220
I haven't heard enough!

24
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:27,926
Qiqi pouted — Always wanting praise...

25
00:01:27,926 --> 00:01:30,632
I'd rather draw a picture...

26
00:01:30,632 --> 00:01:37,264
She used her finger to draw on a star, making a wobbly little flower, and smiled at it.

27
00:01:37,264 --> 00:01:40,764
Mom says You really put your heart into it.

28
00:01:40,764 --> 00:01:43,323
That's what makes me happy!

29
00:01:43,323 --> 00:01:50,485
The Little Prince sat on his tiny planet, drifting through the stars, resting his chin on his hand.

30
00:01:50,485 --> 00:01:54,294
The third planet had a man counting stars.

31
00:01:54,294 --> 00:01:57,867
He sat there, counting and counting.

32
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:03,073
Five hundred and one million... five hundred and one million and one...

33
00:02:03,073 --> 00:02:05,147
What are you doing?

34
00:02:05,147 --> 00:02:07,705
the Little Prince asked.

35
00:02:07,705 --> 00:02:09,882
Counting stars!

36
00:02:09,882 --> 00:02:11,955
They're all mine!

37
00:02:11,955 --> 00:02:14,558
What do you count them for?

38
00:02:14,558 --> 00:02:17,573
To own more, of course!

39
00:02:17,573 --> 00:02:21,176
The Little Prince thought — I have a rose.

40
00:02:21,176 --> 00:02:25,514
I water her every day and cover her with a glass dome.

41
00:02:25,514 --> 00:02:28,985
When she blooms, she's so beautiful!

42
00:02:28,985 --> 00:02:32,602
That's what truly loving something means.

43
00:02:32,602 --> 00:02:36,882
Just counting numbers — you can't even hug a star.

44
00:02:36,882 --> 00:02:39,044
What's the point?

45
00:02:39,044 --> 00:02:41,441
Qiqi said nothing.

46
00:02:41,441 --> 00:02:45,308
She just gently hugged the little star beside her.

47
00:02:45,308 --> 00:02:49,029
The Little Prince looked up at the distant stars.

48
00:02:49,029 --> 00:02:52,529
He thought — Rose, are you okay?

49
00:02:52,529 --> 00:02:55,838
I've learned so much on other planets.

50
00:02:55,838 --> 00:03:00,720
But the place I want to return to most... is right by your side.

51
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:05,514
The Little Prince turned around, and took one step toward home.

